sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant OVMS as OVMS Container<br/>configurable/TCP HTTP
    participant MP as MediaPipe Graph<br/>in-process
    participant OV as OpenVINO Runtime<br/>in-process
    participant HW as CPU/GPU/NPU<br/>hardware

    Note over Client,HW: Flow 1: Model Inference (REST/gRPC)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.3 / Platform Auth
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward request<br/>HTTPS TLS / Bearer Token
    KRBAC->>OVMS: Proxy to backend<br/>HTTP plaintext / No auth
    OVMS->>OV: Execute inference<br/>in-process call
    OV->>HW: Compute on accelerator
    HW-->>OV: Inference result
    OV-->>OVMS: Tensor output
    OVMS-->>KRBAC: JSON/Protobuf response
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: Encrypted response

    Note over Client,HW: Flow 2: LLM Chat Completion (Streaming)
    Client->>OVMS: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP / Bearer Token (API key)
    OVMS->>MP: Route to MediaPipe graph
    MP->>MP: HttpLLMCalculator<br/>Parse chat request
    MP->>OV: ContinuousBatchingPipeline<br/>Token generation
    loop Streaming tokens
        OV-->>MP: Generated token
        MP-->>OVMS: SSE chunk
        OVMS-->>Client: data: {...}\n\n<br/>HTTP SSE streaming
    end
    OVMS-->>Client: data: [DONE]\n\n

    participant S3 as Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over OVMS,S3: Flow 3: Model Loading from Cloud Storage
    OVMS->>S3: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / Cloud IAM credentials
    S3-->>OVMS: Model files
    OVMS->>OVMS: Cache to local filesystem
    OVMS->>OV: Load model into runtime
    OV-->>OVMS: Model ready
